<div class="mb-4">
  <h1 class="page-title"><i class="bi bi-question-circle me-2"></i>Help &amp; Workflows</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">How to run the clinic day-to-day in this app</p>
</div>

<div class="row g-3">
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100">
      <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check me-1"></i>Daily OPD Flow</div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ol class="mb-0">
          <li>Register walk-ins under <strong>Patients</strong> (capture consent + emergency contact).</li>
          <li>Book visits under <strong>Appointments</strong> — same-day bookings get token numbers automatically.</li>
          <li>Open <strong>Calendar</strong> for the day view or <strong>Follow-ups</strong> for due recalls.</li>
          <li>During the visit use <strong>Consult</strong>: vitals, diagnosis, prescription.</li>
          <li><strong>Billing</strong>: generate the bill, record payment, print the invoice or receipt.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100">
      <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-graph-up me-1"></i>Closing the Day</div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ol class="mb-0">
          <li>Check <strong>Dashboard</strong>: collected today vs outstanding dues.</li>
          <li>Record cash expenses under <strong>Expenses</strong> (admin).</li>
          <li>Review <strong>Reports</strong> and export CSVs for the accountant.</li>
          <li>Download a <strong>Backup</strong> from <strong>Settings</strong> before leaving.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100">
      <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-gear me-1"></i>Admin Setup Order</div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ol class="mb-0">
          <li><strong>Settings</strong>: clinic profile, tax %, invoice prefix, security policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Masters</strong>: specializations, categories, statuses, payment methods.</li>
          <li><strong>Treatments</strong> catalog with INR pricing.</li>
          <li><strong>Users</strong>: staff accounts with roles.</li>
          <li><strong>Audit Trail</strong> reviews who changed what.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card h-100">
      <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-keyboard me-1"></i>Tips</div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Every list table paginates (10/page) with a rows-per-page selector and search.</li>
          <li>Use the sidebar search to jump to patients and bills.</li>
          <li>Deactivate (eye icon) master values instead of deleting in-use ones.</li>
          <li>Change your password anytime from the key icon next to Logout.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
